@startuml Sequence Diagram - Agendamento de Consulta
actor Paciente
participant AppointmentsService
participant ClientsService
participant AppointmentsDB

Paciente -> AppointmentsService: POST /appointments (dados consulta)
AppointmentsService -> ClientsService: GET /patients/{id} (valida paciente)
ClientsService --> AppointmentsService: Retorna dados paciente
AppointmentsService -> AppointmentsDB: Salva Appointment
AppointmentsService --> Paciente: Retorna sucesso
@enduml
